    "# Final Assignment: Statistics with Python\n",
    "\n",
    "## Boston Housing Data Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "**Project scenario.** You are a data scientist working with a housing agency in Boston, Massachusetts. You have been given access to the Boston Housing dataset and asked to provide practical statistical insights for management.\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook addresses the following business questions:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Is there a significant difference in the median value of homes bounded by the Charles River?\n",
    "2. How does median home value vary by the proportion of owner-occupied units built prior to 1940?\n",
    "3. Is there a relationship between nitric oxide concentration (`NOX`) and proportion of non-retail business acres (`INDUS`)?\n",
    "4. What is the impact of an additional weighted distance to the five Boston employment centres (`DIS`) on median home value (`MEDV`)?\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook is organized to mirror the course project structure and includes outputs for all code cells.\n"
   ]
  },
