    "## 1) T-test for Charles River (`CHAS`) and median home value (`MEDV`)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Hypotheses**\n",
    "\n",
    "- **H0:** There is no difference in mean/median home values between homes bounded by the Charles River and those not bounded by it.\n",
    "- **H1:** There is a significant difference between the two groups.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Test result**\n",
    "\n",
    "- **t-statistic = -3.9964**\n",
    "- **p-value = 7.3906e-05**\n",
    "\n",
    "Since the p-value is far below 0.05, we **reject H0**. There is a statistically significant difference in home values between the two `CHAS` groups.\n"
   ]
  },
