    "## 2) ANOVA for `MEDV` across age groups\n",
    "\n",
    "An age grouping is commonly defined as:\n",
    "\n",
    "- **35 years and younger**\n",
    "- **between 35 and 70 years**\n",
    "- **70 years and older**\n",
    "\n",
    "**Hypotheses**\n",
    "\n",
    "- **H0:** All group means are equal.\n",
    "- **H1:** At least one group mean differs.\n",
    "\n",
    "**ANOVA result**\n",
    "\n",
    "- **F-statistic = 36.4076**\n",
    "- **p-value = 1.7105e-15**\n",
    "\n",
    "Because the p-value is far below 0.05, we **reject H0**. Median home values differ significantly across the age groups.\n"
   ]
  },
