      "## Final conclusions\n",
      "\n",
      "1. **Homes bounded by the Charles River differ significantly in value** from those that are not.\n",
      "2. **Median home values vary significantly across age groups** based on the proportion of owner-occupied units built before 1940.\n",
      "3. There is a **strong positive relationship between `NOX` and `INDUS`**.\n",
      "4. `DIS` has a **positive slope** in a simple linear regression predicting `MEDV`, though the explanatory power of the model is limited.\n",
      "\n",
      "These conclusions support the use of inferential statistics and regression to provide evidence-based recommendations to management.\n"
